Scope

This MIT license covers the TAPE//CLUB source code written for this project:
the HTML, CSS and JavaScript in dist/ (except dist/vendor/), server.mjs and
tests/.

It does NOT cover the following, which keep their own terms (details in
THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md):

  - dist/assets/*.png, dist/og-image.jpg, dist/icons/ and docs/ images —
    TAPE//CLUB cassette artwork and branding, (c) 2026 Sanjai Builds,
    all rights reserved. Do not reuse without permission.
  - dist/audio/*.mp3 — music by Kevin MacLeod, CC BY 4.0.
  - dist/fonts/ — Space Grotesk, JetBrains Mono, Instrument Serif, SIL OFL 1.1.
